{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows新出现常被滥用的网络扫描器。对应需求：侦察发现。官方：Newly Seen Commonly Abused Network Scanner。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows新出现常被滥用的网络扫描器","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows新出现常被滥用的网络扫描器\n\n### 为何重要\n摸清域、账号、网络或主机\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","references":["https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/cybersecurity-advisories/aa23-319a","https://thedfirreport.com/2025/06/30/hide-your-rdp-password-spray-leads-to-ransomhub-deployment/","https://thedfirreport.com/2020/11/23/pysa-mespinoza-ransomware/","https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2023/07/06/the-five-day-job-a-blackbyte-ransomware-intrusion-case-study/","https://www.cyfirma.com/news/weekly-intelligence-report-26-jan-2024/","https://github.com/Securityinbits/defender-hunt-queries/blob/main/discovery-tools.md"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"64037f09-7bf0-4051-ab51-b6daa1d853c6","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 侦察发现","来源: 默认","对应需求: 侦察发现"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"event.category:process and host.os.type:windows and event.type:start and\n(\n  process.name.caseless:(\n    netscan*.exe or advanced_ip_scanner*.exe or\n    advanced_ip_scanner_console.exe or advanced_port_scanner.exe\n  ) or\n  process.pe.original_file_name : (\n    \"advanced_ip_scanner.exe\" or\n    \"advanced_port_scanner.exe\" or\n    \"advanced_ip_scanner_console.exe\"\n  )\n)\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1018","name":"Remote System Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1018/"},{"id":"T1046","name":"Network Service Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1046/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0007","name":"Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0007/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["host.id","process.executable"],"history_window_start":"now-7d","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"version":1,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
